<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Jawbreaker</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">5 Seconds of Summer</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">EVERYONE'S A STAR! (Fully Evolved)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3D7kb9ygGrPcAjFWc2uCt7</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.840" end="00:07.984">I can't see the end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.984" end="00:10.741">I'm a shallow resident</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.741" end="00:15.047">Holding on to empty space with everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.047" end="00:17.245" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.245" end="00:19.213">Blue and yellow dread</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.213" end="00:22.101">I'm a sunset shattering</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.101" end="00:26.237">Just a stranger to the taste of something sweet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.237" end="00:27.737" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.557" end="00:29.789">And then I saw you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.789" end="00:31.613" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.613" end="00:36.822">Oh, my American jawbreaker</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.822" end="00:42.972">Something from my TV screen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.972" end="00:48.116">Oh, my, my honey, you're a heart shaker</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.116" end="00:51.662">Swinging from the mezzanine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.662" end="00:59.662" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.313" end="01:04.463">Now I can't pretend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.463" end="01:07.321">That my heart's on house arrest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.321" end="01:11.463">All the darker parts of me are caving in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.463" end="01:13.567" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.567" end="01:15.605">Jumping off the fence</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.605" end="01:18.558">And it's feeling like the bends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.558" end="01:23.043">This is everything I didn't know I wanted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.043" end="01:24.543" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.149" end="01:26.627">When I saw you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.627" end="01:28.142" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.142" end="01:33.252">Oh, my American jawbreaker</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.252" end="01:39.376">Something from my TV screen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.376" end="01:44.516">Oh, my, my honey, you're a heart shaker</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.516" end="01:48.516">Swinging from the mezzanine</p></div></body></tt>